# General Architecture & Conventions

- **Project:** Kraepelin Online (Online Psychometric Assessment)
- **Framework:** Next.js 16.4.1 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript 5, Tailwind CSS v4.
- **Reference Docs:** Always refer to `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` before making sweeping structural changes.

## Next.js & React Guidelines
- Server Components by default; only add `"use client"` when component state (`useState`, `useEffect`, `useRef`, browser listeners) is necessary.
- React Compiler is enabled (`reactCompiler: true` in `next.config.ts`), write clean declarative React without unnecessary manual memoization unless profiling shows a bottleneck.
- Do not remove or alter `<!-- BEGIN:nextjs-agent-rules -->` inside `AGENTS.md`.

